{"results": [{"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-058", "score": 0.132, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-058 | Study family SF-APPA-058: Season stability of top suppressors and negative teammate pairs\n- observed_research_question: Season stability of top suppressors and negative teammate pairs\n- auto_outcome_status: rejected\n- observed_hypothesis: Each star's top sequential suppressor is stable across seasons, and some teammate X->Y sequences have large negative premiums.\n- observed_result: 2/30 (7%) stable (>=75% same top suppressor): D. Mitchell PUTBACK 75%, L. James POST_UP 75%. Negative: J. Tatum->K. Porzingis DRIVE->SPOT_UP -0.444 n=31; Giannis->Lillard DRIVE->PNR -0.263 n=31; J. Brown->J. Tatum SPOT_U [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: B_powered_null (adequately powered null result)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Only 2/30 stars meet the 75% same-top-suppressor stability rule.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 30 stars x 4 seasons; min n=20/cell\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_verdict: null"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-011", "score": 0.131, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-011 | Study family SF-APPS-011: Regular season vs playoff PPP by play type (DRIVE over-prediction)\n- observed_research_question: Regular season vs playoff PPP by play type (DRIVE over-prediction)\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: DRIVE PPP is materially higher in RS than playoffs, so an RS-calibrated optimizer over-recommends DRIVE.\n- observed_result: DRIVE RS 1.198 vs PO 0.912 (-0.286, 25 teams); PNR -0.173; PULL_UP +0.301; others within -0.07.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: D_positive (no failure: positive result)\n- observed_failure_evidence: DRIVE playoff PPP 0.286 below RS across 25 teams; top-10 teams all -0.30 to -0.43.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 25 teams, min 30 poss per cell; no CIs\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: Team-level (team, PT, context) cells, min 30 poss, up to 25 teams.\n- observed_verdict: supported\n- observed_failure_type: D_positive\n- observed_notes: Motivated the playoff DRIVE exclusion and a proposed playoff DSI offset."}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPM-022", "score": 0.13, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPM-022 | Study family SF-APPM-022: Superstar suppression profiles (incl. Q5c sequential triggering)\n- observed_research_question: Superstar suppression profiles (incl. Q5c sequential triggering)\n- auto_outcome_status: inconclusive\n- observed_hypothesis: Specific opposing lineups, defenders, play types and preceding opponent play types suppress star efficiency.\n- observed_result: Q5c verdict 'rank-1 suppressor varies meaningfully across players'; e.g. Jokic after opp POST_UP 1.1271 (-0.0675, SE +/-0.0500, n=480); Curry forced POST_UP -0.209.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- observed_failure_evidence: Rank-1 deltas mostly within 1-2 SE with no multiple-comparison control; OTHER artifact flagged in doc.\n- observed_sample_and_power: SE per cell reported\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-050\n- observed_verdict: inconclusive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_confidence: medium (0.65)"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-CHT-025", "score": 0.13, "document": "# FAM:SF-CHT-025 | Study family SF-CHT-025: Play-type labeling audit: OTHER/DRIVE foul leakage\n- observed_research_question: Play-type labeling audit: OTHER/DRIVE foul leakage\n- auto_outcome_status: artifact\n- observed_hypothesis: Play-type PPP differences are real efficiency, not labeling/foul artifacts.\n- observed_result: OTHER: 36% end in fouls, PPP inflated (FOUL_BUCKET). DRIVE: 12pp below foul benchmark (FOUL_LEAK). PNR shows 22% foul rate. Only 335 of 50,668 possessions (0.7%) map to a real play type via initiation_type.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: C_artifact (apparent effect produced by a construction, selection or labelling flaw)\n- observed_failure_evidence: OTHER PPP inflated by 36% foul endings; DRIVE 12pp below foul benchmark; initiation_type maps 0.7%.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 50,668 possessions in the initiation_type check\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: Per-PT diagnostic of foul-ending share vs PPP; initiation_type mapping.\n- observed_verdict: artifact_found"}], "n_results": 4}

