  "estimand": "The average causal effect of a teammate DRIVE preceding a PNR within the same possession on the subsequent PNR's Points Per Possession (PPP) for the team initiating the PNR, controlling for relevant confounders.",
  "unit": "PNR Possession (following a teammate DRIVE).",
  "sample": "All PNR possessions from NBA 2022-23, 2023-24, 2024-25, and 2025-26 (regular season + playoffs) that are immediately preceded by a teammate DRIVE within the same offensive possession. A control group will consist of PNR possessions not immediately preceded by a teammate DRIVE. Minimum 30 possessions per treatment/control cell per team/player combination where possible.",
