  "falsification": "If the analysis reveals a statistically significant *negative* effect of a preceding DRIVE on PNR PPP, or if the effect is inconsistent across different player/team contexts, the hypothesis will be considered falsified. Furthermore, if the effect disappears after accounting for labeling artifacts or key confounders, the hypothesis will also be considered unsupported.",
